  dct:description """LOT1 
New Year's Eve of the year 2000. In a suburb of Athens, Mara is forced to spend her night at the New Year's table organized by her mother with special guests. As the night goes on, the tension escalates. Someone voyeuristically invades Mara's life. Everything seems confusing as the world ends. A film about the gaze. New Year's Eve of the year 2000. In a suburb of Athens, Mara is forced to spend her night at the New Year's table organized by her mother with special guests. As the night goes on, the tension escalates. Someone voyeuristically invades Mara's life. Everything seems confusing as the world ends. A film about the gaze. New Year's Eve of the year 2000. In a suburb of Athens, Mara is forced to spend her night at the New Year's table organized by her mother with special guests. As the night goes on, the tension escalates. Someone voyeuristically invades Mara's life. Everything seems confusing as the world ends. A film about the gaze. 
